Stiff Man Syndrome With
Thymoma
Hisaichi Tanaka, MD, Akihide Matsumura, MD,
Meinoshin Okumura, MD, Masataka Kitaguchi, MD,
Satoru Yamamoto, MD, and Keiji Iuchi, MD
Departments of Surgery and Pathology, National Kinki
